OL,3,APolls to close in the Holborn and St
OL,4,APancras by-election to replace Keir
OL,5,AStarmer as MP
OL,6,
OL,7,FVoting is under way in the Holborn and
OL,8,FSt Pancras by-election, with polls
OL,9,Fclosing at 22:00 when a count will
OL,10,Fbegin
OL,12,FAbout 30 polling stations - at churches
OL,13,Fand community centres - in the north
OL,14,FLondon constituency opened at 07:00
OL,16,FThe seat became vacant after former
OL,17,FPrime Minister Keir Starmer announced
OL,18,Fhe was standing down from the House of
OL,19,FCommons last month
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
