OL,3,APolls to close in the Holborn and St
OL,4,APancras by-election to replace Keir
OL,5,AStarmer as MP
OL,6,
OL,7,FFifteen candidates are standing in the
OL,8,Fby-election - you can read a full list
OL,9,Fhere
OL,11,FThe result is expected to be declared
OL,12,Fbefore breakfast time on Friday
OL,14,FThe BBC, like other broadcasters, is
OL,15,Fnot allowed to report details of
OL,16,Fcampaigning or election issues while
OL,17,Fpolls are open
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
