OL,3,ATwo Latvian men arrested on suspicion
OL,4,Aof trespass at RAF base
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Latvian men were arrested after a
OL,7,Ffence was breached at an RAF base used
OL,8,Fby the US military and Nato for
OL,9,Fintelligence operations,
OL,10,Fcounter-terrorism police have said.
OL,12,FThe alert was raised when a Ministry of
OL,13,FDefence Police (MDP) security patrol at
OL,14,FRAF Molesworth identified an abandoned
OL,15,Fvehicle at about 22:00 BST on
OL,16,FWednesday.
OL,18,FSearches revealed a small breach of the
OL,19,Ffence at the site in Cambridgeshire,
OL,20,Fand a few hours later, police said the
OL,21,Fpair were arrested inside the
OL,22,Fperimeter.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
